# The ground slam: a dive straight down, in the air, 5 s apart. On the tick after it touches the
# ground, everyone in the Shockwave region (a cylinder 5 m around the feet) is thrown away from it
# and up, by every simulation: the brawl mod only hurts them (brawl.slam.hit).

motion Slam on use if brawl.cd_slam <= 0 and not grounded
	lasts 3
	change brawl.cd_slam = 5
	emit brawl.slam.started
	impulse 25 along world direction (0, -1, 0) replace vertical
	then when grounded
	emit brawl.slam.landed
	find Shockwave players
		impulse 9 along away
		impulse 4.5 along up
		emit brawl.slam.hit
